# The local research agent reuses ~/.pi/agent/auth.json and the default model in
# ~/.pi/agent/settings.json. Sign in and choose a default model through Pi first.
# PI_CODING_AGENT_DIR can point to another Pi agent directory.
# Search reuses Pi's web-search.json (configured Exa, or OpenAI hosted search by default).
# No model or search credentials are sent to the browser.

# Optional configured Pi provider/model override (also offered in the app's picker):
# GAME_AGENT_MODEL=openai-codex/gpt-6.1-sol

# Optional absolute conversation database path. By default this is a project-specific
# SQLite file under $DATA/apps/gaming-agent/ (or ~/data/apps/gaming-agent/).
# GAME_AGENT_STORAGE=/absolute/path/to/gaming-agent.sqlite
